{"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The font-family is a list of font names. These can be specific font styles such as Maestro or Opus, or one of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"several generic font styles: music, engraved, handwritten, text, serif, sans-serif, handwritten, cursive,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fantasy, and monospace. The music, engraved, and handwritten values refer to music fonts; the rest refer to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"text fonts. The fantasy style refers to decorative text such as found in older German-style printing.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFont"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFont\/Family-swift.typealias","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"IvorMXL","roleHeading":"Type Alias","title":"MXLFont.Family","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Family","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Family","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"typealias","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLFontV6Familya"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Family"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL21MXLCommaSeparatedTexta","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLCommaSeparatedText","text":"MXLCommaSeparatedText"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlfont\/family-swift.typealias"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLFont/Family-swift.typealias":{"fragments":[{"tex